@k.words.bridge.noun.1 k.words.sense word=bridge pos=noun n=1 gloss="a structure that allows people or vehicles to cross an obstacle such as a river or canal or railway etc." synonym=span is_a=structure part_of="transportation system" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.words.bridge.noun.2 k.words.sense word=bridge pos=noun n=2 gloss="a circuit consisting of two branches (4 arms arranged in a diamond configuration) across which a meter is connected" synonym="bridge circuit" is_a=circuit core.source="wordnet 3.1"
